<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in very heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 66.58 to 5838.52. For the week, the Dow rose 178.66 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 3.97 to 363.70.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.42.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1716 to 719.</p>
<p>Volume was 487,502,110, compared with 398,834,720 Thursday. Volume for the week was 1,947,692,110.</p>
